=== Closed Operators ===
Tag<int> + Tag<int> = 8
Tag<string> + Tag<string> = seven
(-Tag<int>).Held = 7
Twice(Tag<int>(9)) = 9
-Leaf = 7
Leaf * Leaf = 8
Named * Named = b
pair + flipped = 7, flipped + pair = eight
m + 2 = 7
m + wide = wide
m - 1 = byte
m - 300 = long
Keyed<int> + 1 = fixed int
Keyed<string> + k = per instantiation
=== Closed Operators Done ===
